{ bigints.a68 - the module Bigints of a68j.  Generated by
  tools/gen_bignums.py; do not edit.

  Integers of any size, mode Bigint, with the operators of an int.  The
  values are java.math.BigInteger objects (a68j.jlib.BigInt), which never
  change: an operator yields a new Bigint.

  A Bigint is a Java object: a name that refers to no Algol 68 value.  It
  can be passed around, kept in variables (Bigint x := BIG 1) and given to
  the operators and procedures below, but not dereferenced or assigned to.
  IS compares the objects, = compares the values.  For Bigints a and b and
  a value n of mode int, long int or long long int:

      BIG n, BIG s             the Bigint of n, or of the decimal digits in
                               the string s (white space around them, a
                               sign + or - directly before them)
      TOINT a, TOLONGINT a     a as an int or long int; a value beyond the
                               limits is a runtime error
      big_whole (a, width)     a as a string, with the rules of whole
      big_text (a, radix), big_from_text (s, radix)
                               a in the radix 2 to 36, and back
      - a, + a, ABS a          negation, a itself, the absolute value
      SIGN a, ODD a            -1, 0 or 1; whether a is odd
      a + b, a - b, a * b      for a Bigint and a Bigint, int, long int or
      a % b, a OVER b          long long int on either side; % and OVER
      a MOD b, a %* b          truncate toward zero, MOD yields a value
                               from 0 to ABS b - 1
      a = b, a /= b, a < b, a <= b, a > b, a >= b, EQ, NE, LT, LE, GT, GE
                               the same operand modes
      a ** e, a UP e, a ^ e    the power with an int exponent e >= 0
      x +:= b, x -:= b, x *:= b, x %:= b, x %*:= b, PLUSAB, MINUSAB,
      TIMESAB, OVERAB, MODAB   for a variable x of mode ref Bigint and b a
                               Bigint, int, long int or long long int
      big_gcd (a, b)           the greatest common divisor
      big_sqrt (a)             the largest integer whose square is at most a
      big_mod_pow (a, e, m)    a ** e MOD m, for e >= 0 and m > 0
      big_probable_prime (a)   whether a is a prime, with an error
                               probability below 2 ** -100

  The operators have the priorities of the prelude; the module declares
  none, so a program can access it together with Lists, Hashmaps, Texts
  and Genie_Transput.  A NIL Bigint, a division by zero, a negative
  exponent and a value beyond the limits of TOINT are runtime errors.

  Example:

      access Bigints (
          Bigint f := BIG 1;
          for i to 30 do f *:= i od;
          puts (big_whole (f, 0) + "'n")
      )

  Bundled with a68j-backend.jar; a program needs -fnest-java only to
  declare formal holes of its own, not to access this module. }

module Bigints =
def
    pub mode Bigint = ref Bigint_object;
    pub mode Bigint_object = struct (int bigint_java_object);

    proc (int) Bigint j_of_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.of";
    proc (long int) Bigint j_of_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.of";
    proc (long long int) Bigint j_of_long_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.of";
    proc (string) Bigint j_parse = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.parse";
    proc (string, int) Bigint j_parse_radix = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.parseRadix";
    proc (Bigint) int j_to_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.toInt";
    proc (Bigint) long int j_to_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.toLong";
    proc (Bigint, int) string j_whole = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.whole";
    proc (Bigint, int) string j_text = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.text";
    proc (Bigint) Bigint j_negate = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.negate";
    proc (Bigint) Bigint j_abs = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.abs";
    proc (Bigint) int j_sign = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.sign";
    proc (Bigint) bool j_odd = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.odd";
    proc (Bigint, int) Bigint j_pow = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.pow";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_gcd = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.gcd";
    proc (Bigint) Bigint j_sqrt = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.sqrt";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_mod_pow = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.modPow";
    proc (Bigint) bool j_probable_prime = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.probablePrime";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_add = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (Bigint, int) Bigint j_add_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (int, Bigint) Bigint j_int_add = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (Bigint, long int) Bigint j_add_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_int_add = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (Bigint, long long int) Bigint j_add_long_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (long long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_long_int_add = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.add";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_subtract = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (Bigint, int) Bigint j_subtract_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (int, Bigint) Bigint j_int_subtract = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (Bigint, long int) Bigint j_subtract_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_int_subtract = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (Bigint, long long int) Bigint j_subtract_long_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (long long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_long_int_subtract = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.subtract";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_multiply = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (Bigint, int) Bigint j_multiply_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (int, Bigint) Bigint j_int_multiply = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (Bigint, long int) Bigint j_multiply_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_int_multiply = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (Bigint, long long int) Bigint j_multiply_long_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (long long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_long_int_multiply = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.multiply";
    proc (Bigint, Bigint) Bigint j_divide = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.divide";
    proc (Bigint, int) Bigint j_divide_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.divide";
    proc (int, Bigint) Bigint j_int_divide = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.divide";
    proc (Bigint, long int) Bigint j_divide_long_int = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.divide";
    proc (long int, Bigint) Bigint j_long_int_divide = nest Java "a68j.jlib.BigInt.divide";
